Transitional package for the renamed Kazuha Hub Wi-Fi RADIUS proxy.

The site-side Wi-Fi authentication proxy is now os-kazuhahub-wifi-radius-proxy,
which this package depends on so that an ordinary firmware update installs it.
The new package takes over the saved settings unchanged; this one removes what
the former os-kazuhahub-radius service left behind and starts the renamed service. It
can be removed once the router runs os-kazuhahub-wifi-radius-proxy.
